{
  "presses": ["L-index-home-in", "R-index-home-in", "L-middle-home", "L-ring-home"],
  "note": "Plan: chain with fixed pair P=L-index-home-in, Q=R-index-home-in. T1 chord {P,Q,V1=L-middle-home,V2=L-ring-home}. Next: T2 chord {P,Q,V2,V3} where V3=pick next new key; then keep {P,Q,Vi,Vi+1} to deduce letters via overlaps. Update note after seeing symbols/rotations."
}

{
  "presses": ["R-index-home-in", "L-middle-home", "L-ring-home", "L-pinky-top"],
  "locks": {
    "L-ring-home": "I"
  },
  "note": "From last obs: L-ring-home=I (confirmed; not in rotated set). Pressed keys last: {L-index-home-in(P), R-index-home-in(Qkey), L-ring-home(D), L-pinky-top(X)} gave {F,I,Q,U}. Assume X=L-pinky-top=Q(letter) so {P,Qkey}={F,U}, thus L-middle-home(C)=G. Current aim: press {R-index-home-in, L-middle-home, L-ring-home, L-pinky-top} to resolve R-index-home-in in {F,U} and verify L-middle-home/G, L-pinky-top/Q. Note last rotation set after turn: {L-index-bottom, L-index-home-in, R-middle-home}."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-index-top-in", "L-pinky-home", "L-ring-home", "L-middle-home"],
  "note": "T10: no rotation. Press {L-index-bottom-in,L-index-top-in,L-ring-home,L-middle-home}=>{G,I,U,W}. With L-ring-home=I & L-middle-home=G => {L-index-bottom-in,L-index-top-in}={U,W}. Known: L-pinky-home=B; L-index-home-in=E; R-index-home-in=F; R-index-bottom-in=H; L-ring-home=I; L-middle-home=G. Plan T11: press {L-index-top-in,L-pinky-home(B),L-ring-home(I),L-middle-home(G)} to pin which of U/W."
}

{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-home", "L-ring-home", "L-index-top", "L-index-home"],
  "note": "From T11 (no rot): L-pinky-home=B; L-ring-home=I; L-middle-home=G; L-index-home-in=E; R-index-home-in=F; R-index-bottom-in=H; L-index-top-in=U; L-index-bottom-in=W. Unk: L-index-top, L-index-home, ... Plan T12 press {L-pinky-home(B),L-ring-home(I),L-index-top, L-index-home}. Use T13 chord overlap on {L-pinky-home, L-index-top} to deduce L-index-top then infer L-index-home; include 2 other knowns + one new unknown."
}

{
  "presses": [
    "L-pinky-top",
    "L-ring-top",
    "L-middle-home",
    "L-index-bottom-in"
  ],
  "locks": {
    "L-pinky-top": "Q",
    "L-ring-top": "N",
    "L-middle-home": "G",
    "L-middle-bottom": "J"
  },
  "note": "T18: locked L-pinky-top=Q, L-ring-top=N, L-middle-home=G, L-middle-bottom=J (confirmed T17, no rotations). T18 presses {L-pinky-top,L-ring-top,L-middle-home,L-index-bottom-in}; from response, the 4th symbol is exactly L-index-bottom-in."
}
